  "finding": "The reviewed Chinese timer graphics already existed. The dynamic 300-to-0 Translation targets were present in the ordinary exact-RGBA table, while twelve tutorial frames (eleven unique Translation-slot physical payloads) were absent. The PM image-language setter hook also used a stale stack fingerprint, and loading the saved tutorial position did not invoke that setter, so the selector remained UNKNOWN and correctly failed closed.",
