    "translation_slot": "The runtime authenticates the official Translation-field physical payload and replaces it with the Chinese sidecar. The official bitmap can still visibly contain Japanese text.",
    "japanese_slot": "The Japanese-field payload is a different physical identity and is never authorized by these Translation witnesses.",
    "cold_save_bootstrap": "An exact length+FNV-1a+SHA-256 match against one of the eleven Translation-only tutorial payloads may change UNKNOWN to Translation only while the lifecycle is clean and no surface or write lease is active.",
    "live_language_change": "Command 0x237 is accepted only with the observed VM/CInt identities and the corrected main-module parent stack; same-value actions are verified without being treated as fatal anomalies."
  },
